#ASSERT `Art 36(4) third sentence the notifying authority has restricted, suspended or withdrawn the designation` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 36(4) third sentence the notifying authority has restricted, suspended or withdrawn the designation` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 36(4) third sentence the notifying authority has restricted, suspended or withdrawn the designation` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
